                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     | Same      |\n| Delivery pusher length        | 195 cm                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         | Same      |\n| Material                      |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |           |\n| Main Coil Wire                | Platinum/Tungsten Alloy (Pt/W: 92/8)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      